GNOME Shell doesn't expose the focused window to other programs, so keysmith
ships a tiny extension that reports it over D-Bus.

Install:
  cp -r keysmith@keysmith.github.io ~/.local/share/gnome-shell/extensions/
  # Wayland: log out and back in (GNOME only scans for extensions at login)
  gnome-extensions enable keysmith@keysmith.github.io
